---
import SectionHeading from "@/components/shared/SectionHeading.astro";
---

<section id="about" class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-20 md:py-32">
  <div class="max-w-2xl">
    <div data-reveal>
      <SectionHeading title="About Me" />
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-4 text-muted-foreground">
      <p data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1">
        I'm a software engineer focused on cloud infrastructure, DevOps, and
        full-stack web development. I design and build systems on AWS —
        architecting VPCs, managing IAM, deploying containerized workloads, and
        wiring up CI/CD pipelines that ship reliably.
      </p>
      <p data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2">
        On the software side I work across the stack: TypeScript and React on
        the frontend, Node.js and Python on the backend, and Infrastructure as
        Code with CloudFormation and Terraform to keep everything reproducible.
        I'm drawn to the intersection of clean architecture and operational
        reliability.
      </p>
      <p data-reveal data-reveal-delay="3">
        Outside of work you'll find me tinkering with Raspberry Pi projects,
        behind a camera, or exploring somewhere new.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
